# Title: SCM Database Privileged Operation
# ID: dae8171c-5ec6-4396-b210-8466585b53e9
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Roberto Rodriguez @Cyb3rWard0g, Tim Shelton
# Date: 2019-08-15
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548
# Description: Detects non-system users performing privileged operation os the SCM database
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((EventID equals "4674" AND ObjectType equals "SC_MANAGER OBJECT" AND ObjectName equals "servicesactive" AND PrivilegeList equals "SeTakeOwnershipPrivilege") AND NOT ((SubjectLogonId equals "0x3e4" AND ProcessName="*:\\Windows\\System32\\services.exe")))
